                <pb facs="0949" n="2651" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v09p2/pg2651"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations
                        of the United States</hi>, 1952-1954. The Near and Middle East: Volume IX.
                    Please be aware that printed volumes have not been revised.</p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rendition="#bold">1. Index, Page 2628 (date of correction: April 25,
                            2013)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>Erroneous page number (4455) deleted from entry for Saudi Arabia under
                        Dulles, John Foster.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
